            "text": "{\"extractions\":[{\"requirement\":\"Each House shall be the Judge of the Elections, Returns and Qualifications of its own Members\",\"requirement_attributes\":{\"summary\":\"Each House must judge the elections, returns, and qualifications of its own members\",\"actor\":\"Each House\",\"applies_to\":\"\"}},{\"requirement\":\"a Majority of each shall constitute a Quorum to do Business\",\"requirement_attributes\":{\"summary\":\"A majority of each House must constitute a quorum to do business\",\"actor\":\"a Majority of each\",\"applies_to\":\"\"}},{\"permission\":\"a smaller Number may adjourn from day to day\",\"permission_attributes\":{\"summary\":\"A smaller number of members may adjourn from day to day\",\"actor\":\"a smaller Number\",\"applies_to\":\"\"}},{\"permission\":\"may be authorized to compel the Attendance of absent Members\",\"permission_attributes\":{\"summary\":\"A smaller number of members may be authorized to compel the attendance of absent members\",\"actor\":\"a smaller Number\",\"applies_to\":\"\"}},{\"condition\":\"in such Manner, and under such Penalties as each House may provide\",\"condition_attributes\":{\"summary\":\"Compelling attendance must be done in the manner and under penalties provided by each House\",\"actor\":\"each House\",\"applies_to\":\"may be authorized to compel the Attendance of absent Members\"}},{\"permission\":\"Each House may determine the Rules of its Proceedings\",\"permission_attributes\":{\"summary\":\"Each House may determine the rules of its proceedings\",\"actor\":\"Each House\",\"applies_to\":\"\"}},{\"permission\":\"punish its Members for disorderly Behaviour\",\"permission_attributes\":{\"summary\":\"Each House may punish its members for disorderly behavior\",\"actor\":\"Each House\",\"applies_to\":\"\"}},{\"permission\":\"expel a Member\",\"permission_attributes\":{\"summary\":\"Each House may expel a member\",\"actor\":\"Each House\",\"applies_to\":\"\"}},{\"condition\":\"with the Concurrence of two thirds\",\"condition_attributes\":{\"summary\":\"Expelling a member requires the concurrence of two-thirds\",\"actor\":\"Each House\",\"applies_to\":\"expel a Member\"}},{\"requirement\":\"Each House shall keep a Journal of its Proceedings\",\"requirement_attributes\":{\"summary\":\"Each House must keep a journal of its proceedings\",\"actor\":\"Each House\",\"applies_to\":\"\"}},{\"requirement\":\"from time to time publish the same\",\"requirement_attributes\":{\"summary\":\"Each House must publish its journal from time to time\",\"actor\":\"Each House\",\"applies_to\":\"\"}},{\"exception\":\"excepting such Parts as may in their Judgment require Secrecy\",\"exception_attributes\":{\"summary\":\"Parts requiring secrecy are exempt from publication\",\"actor\":\"Each House\",\"applies_to\":\"from time to time publish the same\"}},{\"requirement\":\"the Yeas and Nays of the Members of either House on any question shall, at the Desire of one fifth of those Present, be entered on the Journal\",\"requirement_attributes\":{\"summary\":\"The yeas and nays of members on any question must be entered on the journal\",\"actor\":\"either House\",\"applies_to\":\"\"}},{\"condition\":\"at the Desire of one fifth of those Present\",\"condition_attributes\":{\"summary\":\"Entering yeas and nays requires the desire of one-fifth of those present\",\"actor\":\"one fifth of those Present\",\"applies_to\":\"the Yeas and Nays of the Members of either House on any question shall, at the Desire of one fifth of those Present, be entered on the Journal\"}},{\"prohibition\":\"Neither House, during the Session of Congress, shall, without the Consent of the other, adjourn for more than three days, nor to any other Place than that in which the two Houses shall be sitting\",\"prohibition_attributes\":{\"summary\":\"Neither House shall adjourn for more than three days or to any other place without the consent of the other House during the session of Congress\",\"actor\":\"Neither House\",\"applies_to\":\"\"}},{\"condition\":\"during the Session of Congress\",\"condition_attributes\":{\"summary\":\"The adjournment restriction applies during the session of Congress\",\"actor\":\"Neither House\",\"applies_to\":\"Neither House, during the Session of Congress, shall, without the Consent of the other, adjourn for more than three days, nor to any other Place than that in which the two Houses shall be sitting\"}},{\"condition\":\"without the Consent of the other\",\"condition_attributes\":{\"summary\":\"Adjourning requires the consent of the other House\",\"actor\":\"the other\",\"applies_to\":\"Neither House, during the Session of Congress, shall, without the Consent of the other, adjourn for more than three days, nor to any other Place than that in which the two Houses shall be sitting\"}}]}",
